  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Ruth. You're verified. I found yesterday's ticket for the missing garlic knots on order Q-7690. The agent promised you a $6.50 credit, but it was never applied to your account.\n\nI've now added the $6.50 credit, so your account balance is $6.50. You can use it on a future order. I'm sorry for the delay.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thank you for finding that. I was told it was $10, though, not $6.50. I'm not totally sure of the exact figure, since I didn't write it down, but I remember it being $10. Could you check the ticket notes again to see if it says $10?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I checked the ticket again. It records a promise of $6.50 in account credit for the garlic knots, and nothing about $10. $6.50 is also the full price of the garlic knots on your order. I can only issue what the ticket records, so the $6.50 credit is the right amount, and it's already on your account.\n\nIf you'd rather have a refund to your card than credit, I can't change that now. The credit has already been issued for this item, and I can't compensate the same problem twice.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I understand. I don't have the ticket in front of me, and I'm not certain of the figure, so I'll accept $6.50 since that's what the record shows. Thank you for checking it again.\n\nI'd still appreciate it if you could make a note that I was told $10, in case that comes up later. Other than that, I think we're all set for now."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Ruth. I can't add notes to ticket records from this chat, and I don't want to say I've recorded something when I haven't. This conversation will still show that you remember being told $10 and that you accepted the $6.50 the ticket records. If it comes up later, you can refer back to that.\n\nYour $6.50 credit is on your account and ready for your next order. Enjoy your meal!"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, I appreciate you being straight with me about the note. I'll use the $6.50 on my next order. Have a good day."
  }
